{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>I know that in the integrity of your heart, etc.</b> True, you did not intend at the outset to sin — but clean hands are not here." "<b>I did not let you.</b> It was not from you that you did not touch her — rather, I restrained you from sinning and did not give you the power; so too ״וְלֹא נְתָנוֹ אֱלֹהִים״ (Genesis 31:7), and so too ״וְלֹא נְתָנוֹ אָבִיהָ לָבוֹא״ (Judges 15)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:36.326048626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}